<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sensory-overload</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Sensory Overload</ansi> spell floods the target's senses with overwhelming
psionic stimulation, blinding them and reducing their speed. An
overloaded target stumbles through battle half-sighted and sluggish,
unable to act with their full capability.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast sensory-overload [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 10
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 80
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower resists the sensory flood
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Debuff — blinds the target and reduces their speed

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
